<InfoPage title="Contact us" description="Contact Metadata Remover support for questions about the browser-based metadata removal tool.">
  <p>Need help with Metadata Remover, have a privacy question, or want to report an issue? We would like to hear from you.</p>
  <section><h2>Email support</h2><p><a href="mailto:support@metadataremovertool.com">support@metadataremovertool.com</a></p><p>Please include the file format, browser, and a short description of the issue. Do not send sensitive files by email unless you choose to do so.</p></section>
  <section><h2>Privacy reminder</h2><p>The remover is designed to process supported files locally in your browser. Support cannot access files that you process on the website unless you separately attach or share a file with us.</p></section>
</InfoPage>
